#House Thalendir ("Strive:Conquest - House Thalendir rework proposal" 1.0), the dragon-slayer house
#that holds Erdyna in act 4 - encounter act4_erdyna_estate_fight, formation thalendir_house in
#enemydata predeterminatedgroups. Vaeloria leads two Dracalista ballistae, the Captain and two Guards.
#- Thalendir Duty: every death hands the other non-mech Thalendir a Vengeance stack. At 3 Vengeance
#  (the frontline is down) Vaeloria counters, takes the melee hits aimed at the Dracalista and
#  unlocks Dragon Skewer.
#- Draconic Accusation makes a target count as a dragon, but only for this house's checks (DRACONIC).
#- Every living Dracalista keeps Flight Deterrence on every enemy: it shoots a unit that ends its turn
#  under Flight or Wing Dash ('fly'), and it is how On my Command, Fire! reaches the ballistae.
#  Firing Solution Calculator marks whoever evades a Thalendir attack; only a marked target can be
#  hit by Stake Flak Salvo.
#Everything one unit puts on others (Flight Deterrence, Firing Solution, Phalanx, M'lady, Unyielding
#Dragonslayer) is a temp_global with a timer on its caster's death, so it ends with that unit.

